WEBVTT

01:30.390 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.420 --> 01:37.930
[Episode 24]

01:39.950 --> 01:42.410
As the head of the family, I, Li Zhen,
propose

01:42.479 --> 01:44.880
hanging his portrait in the ancestral hall

01:45.039 --> 01:46.910
so he may receive
the Li family's offerings

01:46.910 --> 01:48.970
alongside our ancestor, Li Tinggui.

01:50.680 --> 01:51.310
Hang...

01:52.400 --> 01:54.860
Hanging his portrait
in the ancestral hall?

01:57.120 --> 01:58.479
Zhen, are you serious?

01:58.680 --> 02:00.480
Sixth Grandfather deserves it.

02:02.590 --> 02:04.310
Just as you said,

02:04.870 --> 02:06.590
Sixth Grandfather risked his life

02:06.590 --> 02:08.789
to bring back this batch of pine timber.

02:09.430 --> 02:11.430
We can't just hand it over like this.

02:12.030 --> 02:14.190
But if we insist
on defending the pine timber at all costs

02:14.190 --> 02:16.390
while ignoring the Li family's crisis,

02:16.560 --> 02:19.020
we will only further betray
his life's work.

02:19.030 --> 02:19.800
So,

02:20.750 --> 02:21.710
Uncle Jingdong,

02:22.590 --> 02:23.870
we have to give them

02:24.430 --> 02:25.890
this batch of pine timber.

02:26.680 --> 02:27.240
However,

02:28.190 --> 02:29.590
we can't give it for free.

02:33.800 --> 02:34.470
Get out!

02:35.000 --> 02:36.280
-Get out!
-Get out!

02:36.280 --> 02:37.740
Get out of Li Ink Workshop!

02:37.960 --> 02:38.840
What is this?

02:38.910 --> 02:39.750
What is this?

02:39.750 --> 02:40.960
Don't come closer!

02:41.079 --> 02:42.750
The 7 days are up!

02:42.840 --> 02:44.079
Hand over the pine timber now!

02:44.079 --> 02:46.000
I don't care about the 7 days!

02:46.360 --> 02:47.750
If you come any closer,

02:48.010 --> 02:49.290
I'll kill you!

02:49.310 --> 02:50.870
Get out! Get out! Get out!

02:51.120 --> 02:51.860
Uncle Jingdong!

02:51.860 --> 02:52.840
Calm down! Calm down!

02:52.840 --> 02:53.800
Stop, stop!

02:53.800 --> 02:54.910
Put down the axe first!

02:54.910 --> 02:55.400
Yes!

02:55.400 --> 02:56.120
Put it down!

02:56.120 --> 02:57.520
I'll ask you one thing!

02:57.630 --> 02:58.750
Are we keeping

02:59.030 --> 03:00.470
the pine timber or not?

03:00.520 --> 03:01.520
Put it down first!

03:01.540 --> 03:02.650
Let's talk!

03:02.680 --> 03:04.400
I'll go talk to them! Okay?

03:04.520 --> 03:05.470
Li Jingdong,

03:06.080 --> 03:08.400
you don't need to play tough
to threaten me.

03:08.400 --> 03:10.600
I'm here on the order of the government.

03:10.680 --> 03:11.800
I must get

03:12.560 --> 03:14.020
this batch of pine timber.

03:14.710 --> 03:15.400
Go!

03:15.400 --> 03:16.710
Who dares!

03:17.560 --> 03:18.750
If you come any closer!

03:18.750 --> 03:19.360
What are you doing?

03:19.360 --> 03:21.000
I'll kill myself!

03:21.430 --> 03:23.000
Every single one of you

03:23.150 --> 03:24.680
will have to pay for my life!

03:24.760 --> 03:26.110
Even if I become a ghost,

03:26.300 --> 03:28.360
-I won't let you go!
-Uncle Jingdong!

03:28.520 --> 03:29.910
Stop messing around, okay?

03:29.910 --> 03:32.750
Put down the axe first! Put it down!

03:32.870 --> 03:35.070
Gentlemen, there's no need to fear him.

03:35.710 --> 03:39.079
Today, Li Jingdong obstructed you
in carrying out imperial orders first.

03:39.079 --> 03:40.390
Even if he dies,

03:41.240 --> 03:42.840
the Tian family will take responsibility.

03:42.840 --> 03:43.430
Go!

03:43.430 --> 03:43.960
Go!

03:45.030 --> 03:45.840
Don't do it!

03:46.120 --> 03:47.180
What are you doing?

03:47.680 --> 03:48.470
Master!

03:52.400 --> 03:53.910
Who dares come any closer?

03:54.540 --> 03:55.650
Don't do it!

03:55.680 --> 03:56.750
On the pine timber,

03:57.120 --> 03:58.400
I have sprinkled

03:58.630 --> 03:59.710
rosin ash!

03:59.870 --> 04:01.630
If anyone takes a step forward,

04:01.630 --> 04:04.000
we will die together!

04:04.000 --> 04:04.910
Are you crazy?

04:04.910 --> 04:05.840
Uncle Jingdong,

04:05.870 --> 04:07.080
I'm begging you.

04:07.710 --> 04:09.910
Can you put down the tinder?

04:09.960 --> 04:12.960
Sixth Grandfather risked his life
to get this batch of pine timber.

04:12.960 --> 04:14.710
If you burn it all—

04:15.000 --> 04:17.240
have you thought about Sixth Grandfather?

04:17.240 --> 04:18.600
This pine timber—

04:19.040 --> 04:21.430
I'd rather burn it and offer it to

04:22.920 --> 04:26.190
my dead father than let them waste it!

04:26.190 --> 04:27.190
Don't you dare, Li Jingdong!

04:27.190 --> 04:28.430
Don't come over!

04:29.310 --> 04:29.920
What are you trying to do?

04:29.920 --> 04:31.050
Don't go over there!

04:31.270 --> 04:32.150
Don't!

04:32.890 --> 04:34.840
Don't you know Li Jingdong's temper?

04:34.840 --> 04:36.159
If he really burns it,

04:36.240 --> 04:37.870
how will you answer to the authorities?

04:37.870 --> 04:38.240
Back off!

04:38.240 --> 04:39.190
Everyone, back off!

04:39.190 --> 04:39.720
Back off!

04:39.830 --> 04:40.390
Back off!

04:40.600 --> 04:41.310
Back off!

04:41.360 --> 04:42.040
Alright, alright!

04:42.040 --> 04:43.070
Back off! Back off!

04:43.070 --> 04:44.070
Go!

04:50.040 --> 04:50.720
Li Zhen.

04:51.790 --> 04:52.990
Name your condition.

04:54.030 --> 04:57.290
As long as you can hold back
that stubborn mule Li Jingdong,

04:57.310 --> 04:58.430
whatever compensation you want,

04:58.430 --> 04:59.430
we can discuss.

04:59.430 --> 05:00.890
That's easy for you to say.

05:01.000 --> 05:03.190
With the pine wilt disease
raging outside right now,

05:03.190 --> 05:06.480
the value of this batch of pine timber
is immeasurable to begin with.

05:06.480 --> 05:07.890
Besides, it is

05:07.920 --> 05:10.190
what Sixth Grandfather sacrificed
his life for.

05:10.190 --> 05:11.800
No matter how huge the compensation,

05:11.800 --> 05:13.600
Uncle Jingdong wouldn't agree.

05:16.360 --> 05:17.560
Everything

05:18.000 --> 05:19.360
has a price.

05:21.560 --> 05:23.560
I'll pay you 3 times the market price

05:23.870 --> 05:25.000
for the pine timber.

05:25.510 --> 05:27.840
That comes to 300 taels.
What do you think?

05:28.040 --> 05:29.240
Three hundred taels?

05:31.490 --> 05:33.000
Go talk to him yourself.

05:33.920 --> 05:35.050
Five hundred taels.

05:35.830 --> 05:37.490
This is the absolute maximum.

05:39.830 --> 05:40.720
Tian Benchang,

05:41.070 --> 05:42.720
why don't you understand?

05:42.750 --> 05:44.390
It's not about the money.

05:45.120 --> 05:46.920
Sixth Grandfather sacrificed his life
for this batch of pine timber.

05:46.920 --> 05:48.580
It was for the future of Li Ink.

05:48.680 --> 05:50.070
A little petty profit

05:50.190 --> 05:52.430
is not enough
to make Uncle Jingdong back down.

05:52.430 --> 05:53.560
Don't you get it?

05:53.720 --> 05:54.480
Zhen,

05:55.159 --> 05:56.040
then tell me,

05:56.390 --> 05:57.790
what exactly do you want?

06:06.630 --> 06:07.630
If you can

06:08.630 --> 06:11.190
give me ten years' right of use

06:11.920 --> 06:13.980
of the Tian family's Linxi pine yard,

06:14.720 --> 06:16.480
I might be able to find a way

06:17.160 --> 06:18.120
to talk to him.

06:19.450 --> 06:22.630
Linxi pine yard is also suffering
from pine wilt disease.

06:22.630 --> 06:23.890
What do you want it for?

06:25.190 --> 06:26.800
To cut down all the pines

06:27.390 --> 06:29.050
and plant tung trees instead.

06:30.070 --> 06:31.190
Tung tree seedlings

06:31.190 --> 06:33.560
take only 3 years to grow and produce oil.

06:33.920 --> 06:37.360
But the impact of the pine wilt disease
will last for several three-year cycles.

06:37.360 --> 06:39.390
Only by replacing pine soot with oil soot

06:39.390 --> 06:41.990
can we ensure
the long-term survival of Li Ink.

06:42.800 --> 06:43.680
Moreover,

06:44.190 --> 06:47.380
Linxi pine yard
is the largest pine yard in Huizhou.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.950
Since I have decided

06:49.159 --> 06:51.490
to change the production method of Li Ink,

06:51.630 --> 06:53.310
I naturally need a piece of land

06:53.310 --> 06:54.800
to plant these tung trees.

06:58.630 --> 06:59.630
Even so,

07:01.480 --> 07:02.480
ten years

07:02.950 --> 07:04.070
is too long.

07:05.630 --> 07:06.680
That is the only way

07:06.680 --> 07:08.270
I can think of right now.

07:08.680 --> 07:10.630
If you don't agree,

07:10.920 --> 07:12.850
then we have nothing to talk about.

07:13.430 --> 07:14.240
Please leave.

07:23.890 --> 07:26.550
My father has deep feelings
for Linxi pine yard.

07:27.430 --> 07:28.950
I cannot agree to this on my own.

07:28.950 --> 07:30.390
I must go back and discuss it with him.

07:30.390 --> 07:32.150
Then, Eldest Young Master Tian,

07:32.150 --> 07:34.000
you'd better reach a decision quickly.

07:34.000 --> 07:35.530
Even if I can afford to wait,

07:35.720 --> 07:37.850
Uncle Jingdong may not be able to wait.

07:38.600 --> 07:39.830
With his temper,

07:40.190 --> 07:41.750
if he loses his mind one day

07:42.240 --> 07:43.900
and burns all the pine timber,

07:44.120 --> 07:44.870
I won't

07:45.720 --> 07:46.790
be able to help.

07:48.720 --> 07:49.650
Wait for my news.

08:01.010 --> 08:02.040
Uncle Jingdong.

08:02.190 --> 08:03.190
Did you get hurt?

08:03.190 --> 08:03.750
I'm fine.

08:03.830 --> 08:04.560
How did it go?

08:05.900 --> 08:06.610
He left.

08:17.720 --> 08:21.070
Is this lampblack
really made from rosin oil?

08:21.070 --> 08:21.870
Yes.

08:22.070 --> 08:24.040
Yesterday I went to the Li pine yard

08:24.270 --> 08:25.560
and dug it out myself.

08:26.430 --> 08:28.220
Everyone is cutting down pines

08:28.630 --> 08:30.490
because of the pine wilt disease.

08:30.830 --> 08:32.080
Few people know

08:32.750 --> 08:34.549
about the rosin under the pines.

08:34.840 --> 08:35.669
Zhen,

08:36.080 --> 08:38.210
it's amazing that you thought of this.

08:39.750 --> 08:41.840
So, Zhen, you mean

08:43.520 --> 08:45.550
using the rosin oil from the pine trees

08:45.550 --> 08:47.600
in the Li pine yard

08:48.360 --> 08:51.480
to solve this material shortage crisis?

08:51.790 --> 08:52.720
Uncle Jingdong,

08:53.080 --> 08:54.000
what I want

08:54.360 --> 08:55.480
is more than that.

08:56.440 --> 08:57.790
Now the Tian family controls

08:57.790 --> 09:00.030
the Linxi pine yard
that once belonged to the Luo family.

09:00.030 --> 09:01.030
And this pine yard

09:01.390 --> 09:03.360
is currently the largest

09:03.360 --> 09:05.160
and oldest pine yard in Huizhou.

09:05.240 --> 09:07.370
I want the right to use Linxi pine yard.

09:09.910 --> 09:11.080
You mean

09:12.000 --> 09:13.720
using our pine timber to trade for

09:13.720 --> 09:15.960
the right to use the Linxi pine yard,

09:16.230 --> 09:17.750
and then dig out

09:17.750 --> 09:19.630
the rosin oil under the pines there

09:19.630 --> 09:20.840
for our use?

09:21.390 --> 09:22.200
Exactly.

09:22.630 --> 09:24.670
If we can get this pine yard,

09:24.720 --> 09:25.750
then for the next few years,

09:25.750 --> 09:28.440
our Li family
will no longer lack pine lampblack,

09:28.440 --> 09:30.370
and the quality will be top-notch.

09:31.510 --> 09:32.470
However,

09:32.720 --> 09:33.670
Tian Benchang

09:34.030 --> 09:35.290
is always suspicious.

09:35.630 --> 09:37.480
Even with the pine wilt disease,

09:37.630 --> 09:39.690
he won't just give the pine yard to us.

09:40.000 --> 09:40.960
So today,

09:41.030 --> 09:44.090
I want to discuss it with you,
Grandpa, Uncle Jingdong.

09:44.550 --> 09:45.360
Now,

09:45.600 --> 09:46.790
I've made it known

09:46.910 --> 09:49.480
that the Li family
will switch to planting tung trees.

09:49.480 --> 09:53.080
I also asked Master Qi to contact
tung tree seedling vendors.

09:53.550 --> 09:54.720
Using this as a cover,

09:54.720 --> 09:56.630
we can secretly collect rosin oil

09:56.870 --> 09:59.200
without attracting anyone's attention.

09:59.630 --> 10:00.270
Also,

10:00.510 --> 10:02.670
if the Tian family comes again,

10:02.840 --> 10:05.150
I'll need Uncle Jingdong
to put on a show with me,

10:05.150 --> 10:08.350
pretending to fight over the pines
and have a falling out.

10:08.960 --> 10:10.630
I must let Tian Benchang know

10:11.390 --> 10:12.630
that for this deal,

10:12.840 --> 10:14.440
he can only negotiate with me

10:14.480 --> 10:16.550
to get this batch of pine timber.

10:17.440 --> 10:18.360
I see.

10:18.670 --> 10:19.390
Zhen,

10:19.600 --> 10:22.440
just tell me how to act.

10:22.550 --> 10:25.080
Should I go all out or hold back?

10:25.250 --> 10:27.400
Just act like Tian Jiangyue did.

10:28.390 --> 10:29.790
The crazier, the better.

10:30.430 --> 10:32.960
What's the situation
with Tian Benchang now?

10:33.630 --> 10:36.440
Given his suspicious nature,

10:36.670 --> 10:37.790
getting him to believe most of it

10:37.790 --> 10:39.120
is already good enough.

10:39.390 --> 10:41.790
We still need to work on the rest.

10:41.840 --> 10:42.390
Okay.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.320
Uncle Jingdong,

10:45.910 --> 10:47.840
thank you for your understanding.

10:48.240 --> 10:49.150
I know

10:49.320 --> 10:50.320
that for you,

10:50.730 --> 10:53.330
giving up this batch of pine timber
is not easy.

10:54.720 --> 10:57.080
I should be thanking you.

10:57.440 --> 11:00.080
You came up with such a good idea.

11:01.790 --> 11:04.030
I have a bad temper.

11:04.510 --> 11:06.030
About what happened before,

11:06.030 --> 11:07.690
please don't take it to heart.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.870
Speaking of bad tempers,

11:09.870 --> 11:11.510
I'm no better than you.

11:11.630 --> 11:12.990
We

11:13.240 --> 11:14.240
have the same temper.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.900
We are both from the Li family.

11:18.870 --> 11:21.240
I thought Li Zhen
would hold out this time.

11:21.270 --> 11:23.750
I was planning to use this
to pin a charge on her.

11:23.750 --> 11:25.950
I didn't expect her to give in so easily.

11:26.480 --> 11:27.600
She's smart.

11:29.840 --> 11:30.480
Father,

11:31.080 --> 11:32.680
what do you think about this?

11:35.200 --> 11:37.510
Since this girl Li Zhen has given in,

11:38.150 --> 11:40.350
she has likely offended the hardliners

11:40.600 --> 11:41.840
in the Li family.

11:46.150 --> 11:48.150
Li Zhen asked for the Linxi pine yard

11:48.320 --> 11:50.120
to plant tung trees.

11:52.720 --> 11:54.240
That's an idea.

11:55.270 --> 11:58.270
But there are still some things
that don't make sense.

11:58.840 --> 12:00.640
The price of tung oil is high now,

12:00.790 --> 12:02.720
but it will definitely drop later.

12:02.790 --> 12:05.000
If the Li family
wants to make oil soot ink,

12:05.000 --> 12:07.260
they can just buy it
when the price is low.

12:07.360 --> 12:10.220
It's not worth planting tung trees
on a large scale.

12:10.720 --> 12:12.450
She didn't even consider this?

12:14.240 --> 12:17.320
She only makes ink at home all day.

12:17.910 --> 12:19.360
When it comes to business,

12:19.360 --> 12:21.600
she is a bit short-sighted after all.

12:22.390 --> 12:24.360
She's far worse than you.

12:24.480 --> 12:25.540
Perhaps.

12:26.630 --> 12:29.150
Anyway, I'll go check it out
these two days

12:30.480 --> 12:32.210
and wait a bit before replying.

13:01.030 --> 13:03.630
Aren't you going to ask me
how things are going?

13:03.870 --> 13:04.440
I...

13:04.550 --> 13:06.750
I was waiting for you to finish your tea.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.120
Don't mention it.

13:09.030 --> 13:10.240
As you requested,

13:10.440 --> 13:11.960
I spread the fake news

13:11.960 --> 13:13.030
about buying tung tree seedlings.

13:13.030 --> 13:15.600
And all the seedling merchants in Huizhou
came to me.

13:15.600 --> 13:16.600
I did sign a few orders,

13:16.600 --> 13:18.080
but I didn't dare to waste any more money,

13:18.080 --> 13:19.200
so I hurried back.

13:21.720 --> 13:22.850
What about your end?

13:22.960 --> 13:24.480
Did Tian agree to trade

13:24.480 --> 13:26.740
the Linxi pine yard for your pine timber?

13:27.910 --> 13:29.910
The Tian family hasn't replied yet.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.110
If we wait any longer,

13:32.390 --> 13:34.510
this order will be delayed.

13:36.030 --> 13:37.560
The Tians are all scumbags.

13:41.200 --> 13:42.560
Except for your friend.

13:47.360 --> 13:48.040
Zhen,

13:48.320 --> 13:49.360
how about this?

13:49.890 --> 13:53.080
Let's first dig out the rosin oil from
the Li pine yard for the time being.

13:53.080 --> 13:54.240
Absolutely not.

13:54.760 --> 13:56.350
Tian Benchang is hesitating now

13:56.350 --> 13:57.870
because he suspects this matter.

13:57.870 --> 13:59.080
If he finds out,

13:59.080 --> 14:01.010
our entire plan will fall through.

14:03.240 --> 14:04.950
Master Qi, we'll have to

14:05.150 --> 14:06.630
keep up this act—

14:06.790 --> 14:09.150
and make it even more convincing.

14:09.720 --> 14:11.200
Continue buying tung tree seedlings.

14:11.200 --> 14:13.360
Ask around everywhere
and buy from everywhere.

14:13.360 --> 14:14.270
And most importantly,

14:14.270 --> 14:16.670
Tian Benchang
must see it with his own eyes.

14:16.960 --> 14:18.480
The sooner the Tian family agrees,

14:18.480 --> 14:20.270
the sooner we can begin work.

14:22.670 --> 14:24.200
Okay, got it.

14:25.000 --> 14:27.260
I'll try to get more done with less money.

14:35.080 --> 14:36.840
Master, he is here.

14:43.120 --> 14:43.790
Enjoy.

14:45.910 --> 14:48.080
This contract for the tung tree seedlings

14:48.080 --> 14:49.630
was handled very well.

14:52.200 --> 14:53.080
Master Qi?

14:55.300 --> 14:57.430
We haven't seen each other for a while.

14:57.910 --> 15:00.370
Somehow, things already feel so different.

15:00.550 --> 15:01.610
Young Master Tian?

15:02.390 --> 15:03.390
Please, sit.

15:04.000 --> 15:04.600
Sit.

15:19.670 --> 15:21.270
Excuse me.

15:26.960 --> 15:28.200
I almost forgot—

15:29.440 --> 15:32.390
the Tian family is honored to supply
pine soot ink to the imperial court

15:32.390 --> 15:33.790
because of Li Ink's help.

15:34.200 --> 15:34.840
Yes.

15:35.150 --> 15:37.680
I heard you now take orders
from the Li family.

15:37.720 --> 15:39.720
Allow me to offer tea in place of wine

15:39.840 --> 15:41.390
as thanks.

15:43.270 --> 15:45.000
You are the lackey of a heretic.

15:45.320 --> 15:46.960
Shameless.

15:51.910 --> 15:53.440
What are you talking about?

15:56.270 --> 15:57.330
Young Master Tian,

15:58.320 --> 15:59.480
Xiao Qi is ignorant.

16:00.360 --> 16:02.080
I'll drink this tea instead of wine.

16:02.080 --> 16:03.030
Let's drink.

16:24.200 --> 16:25.260
Young Master Tian,

16:26.390 --> 16:27.720
what do you mean by that?

16:28.000 --> 16:30.530
The Sage's reputation
must not be tarnished.

16:30.550 --> 16:31.790
Please, Master Qi,

16:32.320 --> 16:33.600
control your dog.

16:33.670 --> 16:34.270
You...

16:37.200 --> 16:40.930
Young Master Tian, I think there's
something wrong with your eyes.

16:41.440 --> 16:42.770
I don't see any dog here.

16:47.390 --> 16:48.960
Xiao Qi is my brother.

16:50.840 --> 16:52.170
For what just happened,

16:52.440 --> 16:54.700
consider it my punishment on his behalf.

16:55.690 --> 16:57.500
Do you have any other business?

16:58.360 --> 16:59.910
If not,

17:00.360 --> 17:02.270
I still have duties to attend to
at the Li family.

17:02.270 --> 17:02.870
Farewell.

17:03.480 --> 17:04.310
Master Qi.

17:04.920 --> 17:05.960
No need to rush.

17:07.550 --> 17:09.210
Let me treat you to a pot of tea.

17:09.270 --> 17:10.800
Have some tea before you go.

17:15.270 --> 17:17.470
Please bring us your best Shengjin tea.

17:17.720 --> 17:18.480
Okay!

17:19.000 --> 17:20.160
Young Master Tian,

17:20.550 --> 17:22.230
why go to such expense?

17:23.750 --> 17:25.880
We haven't seen each other
for a long time,

17:25.880 --> 17:28.270
and your temperament
has changed quite a bit.

17:28.270 --> 17:29.160
It seems that

17:29.750 --> 17:33.010
even with her own people,
Li Zhen is still hard to deal with.

17:33.110 --> 17:34.680
She's actually managed
to turn a proper man like you

17:34.680 --> 17:36.110
into a spineless puppet.

17:36.880 --> 17:37.750
Interesting.

17:41.000 --> 17:41.790
Enjoy, sir.

17:46.110 --> 17:47.310
Keep the change.

17:48.110 --> 17:49.590
Thank you, sir.

17:50.240 --> 17:51.790
You are indeed generous.

17:53.240 --> 17:53.920
True.

17:55.960 --> 17:57.820
Now that you've lost your status,

17:58.270 --> 18:00.270
it's only natural to be submissive.

18:03.110 --> 18:04.440
Originally, this tea

18:05.000 --> 18:06.790
was truly worthy of

18:07.310 --> 18:09.070
that generous Master Qi.

18:10.240 --> 18:11.030
What a pity.

18:14.240 --> 18:15.750
Its aroma is too fine

18:16.070 --> 18:19.000
for a mere ink workshop worker.

18:24.920 --> 18:25.790
Now,

18:26.640 --> 18:27.880
it suits you.

18:33.590 --> 18:34.830
You dog.

18:36.510 --> 18:39.440
You are the dog!
Just wait till you fall into my hands!

18:40.400 --> 18:41.000
Xiao Qi.

18:41.790 --> 18:42.350
Xiao Qi.

18:44.640 --> 18:46.480
Master, how can you still have the mood
to eat?

18:46.480 --> 18:48.000
He just humiliated you like that.

18:48.000 --> 18:49.730
Why are we putting up with this?

18:50.400 --> 18:52.330
Sit down. I'll tell you the reason.

18:54.830 --> 18:55.590
Xiao Qi.

18:59.920 --> 19:01.450
When a villain gains power,

19:02.270 --> 19:04.200
you have to let him flaunt it.

19:06.750 --> 19:07.880
For now,

19:09.000 --> 19:11.130
if we want him to say yes to Miss Li Zhen,

19:12.310 --> 19:14.040
we need him to become arrogant—

19:15.160 --> 19:16.310
and then overreach.

19:20.400 --> 19:22.800
Besides, we've already endured this long.

19:23.480 --> 19:25.740
Does it matter if we wait a little longer?

19:28.640 --> 19:31.110
I'll settle new

19:32.550 --> 19:34.410
and old scores with him together.

19:39.070 --> 19:40.110
I'm so pissed!

19:42.200 --> 19:43.600
Drink the expensive one.

19:50.960 --> 19:53.070
Fourth Young Lady, big news.

19:53.830 --> 19:54.750
Big news?

19:55.920 --> 19:57.350
Good or bad?

19:57.400 --> 19:58.200
Bad.

19:59.110 --> 20:00.830
No, it's actually good.

20:01.350 --> 20:02.720
For that batch of pine timber,

20:02.720 --> 20:05.240
Li Zhen and the Sixth Branch have nearly
fallen out completely.

20:05.240 --> 20:07.440
Li Zhen is now giving away the pine timber

20:07.440 --> 20:08.960
and plans to switch to planting
tung tree seedlings instead.

20:08.960 --> 20:11.090
The ink workshop is in a state of panic.

20:11.700 --> 20:13.350
I asked Mr. Liu, who's familiar with us,

20:13.350 --> 20:14.590
about it.

20:14.720 --> 20:17.550
He said the ink-makers
are very dissatisfied with Li Zhen—

20:17.550 --> 20:19.680
and some are even threatening to quit.

20:23.480 --> 20:25.960
This is truly heaven helping us.

20:32.240 --> 20:34.510
Take this money and give it to Mr. Liu.

20:34.550 --> 20:37.400
Tell him to take the lead in
making trouble for Li Zhen.

20:37.400 --> 20:39.830
As long as someone dares
to take the first step,

20:39.830 --> 20:41.510
the others will follow suit.

20:41.920 --> 20:42.550
Yes.

20:43.270 --> 20:43.920
Wait.

20:50.960 --> 20:52.960
Tell him to make
as much trouble as possible.

20:52.960 --> 20:54.440
If he really has to leave Li Ink,

20:54.440 --> 20:56.830
I will make up his monthly salary.

20:57.590 --> 20:58.310
Yes.

21:01.140 --> 21:02.580
Steward Shao, look.

21:02.610 --> 21:04.570
On the 22nd,

21:04.680 --> 21:06.790
we received 100 soot cakes.

21:14.160 --> 21:15.360
What's going on here?

21:16.350 --> 21:18.350
Steward Shao, I'm here

21:18.350 --> 21:19.880
to speak with Manager Zhen.

21:23.270 --> 21:24.750
Why are there so many people?

21:24.750 --> 21:27.030
Gentlemen, is something wrong?

21:27.590 --> 21:28.510
Manager Zhen,

21:29.000 --> 21:30.930
I'm not one to beat around the bush.

21:31.070 --> 21:31.920
Today,

21:31.960 --> 21:33.590
in front of all these people,

21:33.790 --> 21:35.680
please give us a clear answer—

21:35.960 --> 21:39.000
Is Li Ink going to switch
to planting tung trees

21:39.110 --> 21:40.640
and producing oil soot ink?

21:43.000 --> 21:45.200
Since you're all our own people,

21:45.480 --> 21:47.240
I won't hide it from you.

21:47.640 --> 21:48.310
Yes,

21:48.920 --> 21:52.160
the Tian family holds an official order
and is forcibly taking the pine timber.

21:52.160 --> 21:54.160
We have no choice but to hand it over.

21:54.350 --> 21:57.070
And now that the pine wilt disease
is rampant outside,

21:57.070 --> 21:58.880
pinewood is extremely hard to come by.

21:58.880 --> 22:00.440
The only way to reduce our losses

22:00.440 --> 22:02.570
is to switch to producing oil soot ink.

22:02.830 --> 22:03.750
Manager Zhen,

22:04.030 --> 22:06.440
this is not something
that can be changed easily.

22:06.440 --> 22:08.310
Li Ink's foundation is pine soot ink.

22:08.310 --> 22:09.790
Even if we can produce oil soot ink,

22:09.790 --> 22:11.310
it won't give us any advantage.

22:11.310 --> 22:13.240
The risk is too great.

22:13.350 --> 22:15.350
Please reconsider, Manager Zhen.

22:15.830 --> 22:18.270
I understand your concerns.

22:19.310 --> 22:21.030
This decision to switch to oil soot ink

22:21.030 --> 22:24.240
was made after careful consideration.

22:25.070 --> 22:25.750
Everyone,

22:26.240 --> 22:28.750
Li Ink is going through
a difficult time right now.

22:28.750 --> 22:30.350
But as long as we stay united,

22:30.350 --> 22:32.880
the business will gradually
get back on track.

22:32.880 --> 22:34.960
I hope you can trust me.

22:34.960 --> 22:36.350
So after all that,

22:36.750 --> 22:38.750
it's just your own wishful thinking.

22:38.750 --> 22:39.810
Let me ask you this—

22:39.880 --> 22:42.000
did the Sixth Branch Master

22:42.240 --> 22:44.440
agree to such a drastic change?

22:44.790 --> 22:46.350
Right now, all of us

22:46.400 --> 22:49.350
have doubts about your decision.

22:49.480 --> 22:50.750
How can we stay united?

22:51.070 --> 22:51.830
Today,

22:52.200 --> 22:53.930
we're here for an explanation.

22:54.160 --> 22:56.350
If you insist

22:56.350 --> 22:58.310
on going your own way,

22:58.510 --> 23:00.270
then we'll have no choice but to resign.

23:00.270 --> 23:02.510
Don't you agree, everyone?

23:02.590 --> 23:04.350
Yes, yes!

23:04.350 --> 23:05.030
Mr. Liu!

23:06.200 --> 23:07.730
What are you talking about?

23:07.960 --> 23:09.030
Zhen.

23:10.960 --> 23:12.790
Eldest Aunt, why are you here?

23:13.870 --> 23:15.730
I came to bring you some pastries.

23:16.200 --> 23:17.920
What is going on here?

23:18.920 --> 23:21.110
Eldest Young Lady, please be the judge.

23:21.110 --> 23:24.350
Can switching to producing oil soot ink
really save Li Ink?

23:24.350 --> 23:25.440
Do you believe it?

23:26.400 --> 23:27.000
We don't believe it!

23:27.000 --> 23:28.510
We would rather work somewhere else.

23:28.510 --> 23:29.270
Don't you agree?

23:29.270 --> 23:29.790
Yes!

23:29.790 --> 23:31.320
We'll work somewhere else!

23:31.440 --> 23:33.110
Calm down, everyone!

23:33.880 --> 23:35.080
Don't be so agitated.

23:35.240 --> 23:37.720
Talk it over with Zhen.

23:37.720 --> 23:39.250
There's always a solution.

23:39.440 --> 23:40.500
Eldest Young Lady,

23:40.590 --> 23:43.270
we are completely loyal to Li Ink.

23:43.550 --> 23:44.510
Actually,

23:44.830 --> 23:47.030
we just don't trust this new manager.

23:47.480 --> 23:49.200
Pardon my bluntness.

23:49.550 --> 23:50.720
The new manager

23:50.880 --> 23:52.070
is too young.

23:52.110 --> 23:53.770
How much has she experienced?

23:53.920 --> 23:56.880
I beg you, Eldest Young Lady,
to make a decision.

23:57.510 --> 24:00.910
Have Manager Zhen hand over power
to the Sixth Branch Master.

24:00.920 --> 24:04.070
We cannot let her act arbitrarily anymore.

24:04.310 --> 24:06.550
If the Sixth Branch Master
returns as manager,

24:06.550 --> 24:08.480
we will have no complaints.

24:08.640 --> 24:10.350
If she remains in charge,

24:10.550 --> 24:12.030
we will have to quit.

24:12.030 --> 24:12.790
That's right!

24:12.790 --> 24:14.510
If Manager Zhen steps down, we'll stay!

24:14.510 --> 24:15.680
Right?

24:15.680 --> 24:16.970
Yes, step down!

24:17.000 --> 24:19.880
Step down! Step down! Step down!

24:20.110 --> 24:21.790
How dare you!

24:21.810 --> 24:24.810
Step down! Step down! Step down!

24:25.320 --> 24:27.080
Everyone, calm down!

24:27.750 --> 24:28.880
I understand.

24:29.550 --> 24:32.880
You are all doing this
out of concern for Li Ink.

24:32.880 --> 24:34.680
I know it well.

24:34.880 --> 24:37.160
But switching to oil soot ink now

24:37.200 --> 24:39.830
is the most practical solution.

24:39.830 --> 24:41.000
Right now,

24:41.400 --> 24:43.000
there really is no other way.

24:43.920 --> 24:45.110
I

24:45.830 --> 24:46.890
will not back down.

24:47.680 --> 24:48.830
Nor will I step down.

24:50.480 --> 24:51.590
To be honest,

24:52.720 --> 24:54.640
I don't want you to leave.

24:55.240 --> 24:56.030
However,

24:56.110 --> 24:58.070
I can't dictate your thoughts.

24:58.830 --> 25:00.090
Those who want to stay,

25:00.550 --> 25:01.590
I welcome you.

25:01.960 --> 25:03.240
In the future, Li Ink

25:03.550 --> 25:04.830
will treat you well.

25:05.830 --> 25:07.160
But if you want to leave

25:07.430 --> 25:08.920
and find a better job,

25:09.310 --> 25:11.880
I won't hold you back.

25:12.030 --> 25:14.110
Let's part on good terms.

25:15.440 --> 25:16.350
Steward Shao.

25:16.590 --> 25:18.070
For those who want to leave,

25:18.070 --> 25:20.920
please settle their accounts
and prepare red envelopes.

25:20.920 --> 25:22.780
Don't make it difficult for them.

25:24.200 --> 25:26.160
Alright, the matter is settled.

25:26.720 --> 25:27.720
You can leave now.

25:37.160 --> 25:38.960
What's wrong?

25:39.110 --> 25:41.030
Is there something inappropriate?

25:41.030 --> 25:43.000
If we really leave the Li family,

25:43.110 --> 25:44.590
where else can we go?

25:44.640 --> 25:45.590
Yeah. That's right.

25:45.590 --> 25:47.400
There are so many ink workshops
in Huizhou.

25:47.400 --> 25:49.590
You think we can't find a place to go?

25:51.350 --> 25:52.410
Eldest Young Lady.

25:52.880 --> 25:53.720
Steward Shao.

25:54.270 --> 25:55.830
You've all seen it clearly.

25:56.000 --> 25:57.640
We tried to persuade her nicely,

25:57.640 --> 25:59.480
but she insists on having her way,

25:59.480 --> 26:01.710
ignoring the foundation of the Li family.

26:01.710 --> 26:02.990
I am powerless to help.

26:03.070 --> 26:05.400
In that case,
we have no choice but to quit.

26:06.640 --> 26:07.480
Farewell.

26:12.720 --> 26:13.510
Move!

26:14.200 --> 26:14.720
Mr. Liu!

26:15.110 --> 26:15.920
Mr. Liu!

26:16.270 --> 26:16.750
Let's go!

26:16.750 --> 26:17.960
-Mr. Liu!
-Mr. Liu!

26:18.270 --> 26:19.480
Mr. Liu! Mr. Liu!

26:20.160 --> 26:20.880
Mr. Liu.

26:21.750 --> 26:22.440
Alright.

26:22.480 --> 26:23.880
Dismissed. Stop looking.

26:23.880 --> 26:26.000
Those who want to quit,
go to Steward Shao.

26:26.000 --> 26:27.030
Those who don't want to quit,

26:27.030 --> 26:29.070
stay and keep working.

26:29.640 --> 26:30.350
Dismissed.

26:31.920 --> 26:32.750
Zhen.

26:39.030 --> 26:39.920
Zhen.

26:40.750 --> 26:42.510
So many workers want to quit.

26:43.240 --> 26:44.570
This is no small matter.

26:44.880 --> 26:46.790
Why don't you
discuss it with your Uncle Jingdong?

26:46.790 --> 26:47.790
What do you think?

26:48.030 --> 26:50.590
Eldest Aunt, do you trust me?

26:51.750 --> 26:53.960
If some people want to leave,

26:54.110 --> 26:55.240
forcing them to stay

26:55.440 --> 26:57.750
will make it hard for them
to work with us wholeheartedly.

26:57.750 --> 26:58.720
Rest assured.

26:58.750 --> 27:00.680
I will handle this matter properly.

27:00.680 --> 27:02.120
When the time is right,

27:02.310 --> 27:04.710
I will definitely give you an explanation.

27:04.920 --> 27:05.830
Manager Zhen.

27:07.200 --> 27:08.000
Manager Zhen.

27:08.270 --> 27:09.330
Eldest Young Lady.

27:09.400 --> 27:11.030
Master Qi has returned.

27:11.030 --> 27:12.960
He said he brought some people
selling tung tree seedlings

27:12.960 --> 27:13.680
to see you.

27:13.720 --> 27:14.270
Let's go.

27:15.480 --> 27:16.640
Eldest Aunt, I'll go first.

27:16.640 --> 27:17.590
Go ahead.

27:24.310 --> 27:25.240
Uncle Jingdong.

27:25.750 --> 27:27.590
What on earth is going on, Zhen?

27:28.550 --> 27:29.510
Uncle Jingdong.

27:30.030 --> 27:30.690
Be careful.

27:31.240 --> 27:33.360
[Resignation]

27:36.590 --> 27:38.680
Don't worry. Let's sit down and talk.

27:38.680 --> 27:40.070
Come. Be careful.

27:43.750 --> 27:45.160
Today, the workers

27:45.200 --> 27:47.200
came in crowds to quit.

27:47.830 --> 27:49.310
I couldn't tell them

27:49.310 --> 27:50.750
about the rosin oil plan.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.550
Rather than

27:52.750 --> 27:55.200
wasting my breath arguing with them,

27:55.440 --> 27:56.840
I might as well play along

27:57.120 --> 27:59.320
and put on this show of discord

27:59.480 --> 28:00.640
to the fullest.

28:01.200 --> 28:02.680
You mean

28:03.240 --> 28:05.030
this is also a show for the Tian family?

28:05.030 --> 28:06.000
Exactly.

28:06.330 --> 28:08.060
It's a show for the Tian family.

28:09.240 --> 28:11.030
We need the Tian family to truly believe

28:11.030 --> 28:13.440
that Li Ink has reached a dead end,

28:13.750 --> 28:16.590
and because I advocated
giving up the pine timber

28:16.830 --> 28:18.440
and insisted on
planting tung trees instead,

28:18.440 --> 28:20.370
I've become a target of the family.

28:20.400 --> 28:21.590
This show

28:21.590 --> 28:23.550
matches our previous plan.

28:23.750 --> 28:25.640
The purpose
is to reduce the Tian family's doubts

28:25.640 --> 28:26.830
even further.

28:28.860 --> 28:30.300
As for that Liu,

28:31.480 --> 28:33.720
ever since Li Ink
suffered losses this year,

28:33.720 --> 28:36.240
he has been slacking off at work.

28:36.640 --> 28:37.920
The laborers under him

28:37.920 --> 28:39.640
have all been in cahoots with him.

28:39.640 --> 28:41.240
I've long had it out for them.

28:41.790 --> 28:43.030
Now that these people are gone,

28:43.030 --> 28:45.310
I actually feel relieved.

28:47.310 --> 28:48.440
Be that as it may,

28:48.510 --> 28:49.720
there are still those

28:49.720 --> 28:52.240
master craftsmen who are loyal to Li Ink.

28:53.110 --> 28:56.200
They will inevitably
have doubts in their hearts.

28:56.640 --> 28:59.070
How about I tell them the truth?

28:59.200 --> 28:59.960
No.

29:00.640 --> 29:02.160
Right now is the most crucial moment

29:02.160 --> 29:04.090
in our battle with the Tian family.

29:04.110 --> 29:07.770
We can't be soft-hearted just because
of a temporary difficulty.

29:08.480 --> 29:10.480
The matter of mortgaging the farmland
back then

29:10.480 --> 29:12.480
was spread by that Tian Jiangyue...

29:13.240 --> 29:14.750
that Fourth Aunt.

29:15.400 --> 29:16.350
That

29:16.790 --> 29:18.350
caused us a lot of trouble.

29:19.150 --> 29:19.940
Therefore,

29:20.160 --> 29:22.220
we can't make the same mistake again.

29:23.720 --> 29:26.110
It's not that I don't trust
those craftsmen,

29:26.110 --> 29:29.160
but this plan leaves no room for error.

29:29.240 --> 29:30.640
We must play it safe.

29:32.960 --> 29:34.270
To be honest,

29:34.550 --> 29:36.680
Mr. Ma and Mr. Qin

29:36.830 --> 29:38.830
have already come to me.

29:39.440 --> 29:41.640
I almost wore my lips out talking

29:41.640 --> 29:43.440
just to calm them down.

29:46.550 --> 29:47.590
Uncle Jingdong.

29:48.160 --> 29:50.070
Why don't you continue

29:50.400 --> 29:52.060
playing along with this show?

29:53.110 --> 29:54.400
To outsiders,

29:54.640 --> 29:57.270
we are already at odds with each other.

29:57.680 --> 29:59.380
Why not take advantage
of today's disturbance

29:59.380 --> 30:00.750
and add fuel to the fire?

30:02.160 --> 30:04.680
You go and bring those master craftsmen
to your side,

30:04.680 --> 30:06.880
and then make me a complete target

30:06.920 --> 30:08.350
and make a few more scenes.

30:08.350 --> 30:09.720
Firstly, it's for the Tian family to see.

30:09.720 --> 30:11.880
Secondly,
it will make those craftsmen think

30:11.880 --> 30:14.160
that you, Uncle Jingdong,
are backing them up.

30:14.160 --> 30:16.640
Then they will naturally feel at ease.

30:18.110 --> 30:19.590
It's a good idea,

30:20.070 --> 30:22.600
but you will have to suffer
a grievance again.

30:23.310 --> 30:24.270
Uncle Jingdong.

30:24.680 --> 30:26.510
We just want what's the best for Li Ink.

30:26.510 --> 30:28.440
This little grievance is nothing.

30:33.400 --> 30:34.750
You're not angry anymore?

30:34.750 --> 30:36.010
I'm not angry anymore.

30:42.750 --> 30:43.590
How was it?

30:43.750 --> 30:44.590
It worked.

30:45.010 --> 30:46.690
Just as you expected.

30:46.720 --> 30:47.960
With Mr. Liu taking the lead,

30:47.960 --> 30:51.070
the master craftsmen at the ink workshop
couldn't sit still.

30:51.070 --> 30:53.160
In the past few days,
Mr. Ma, Mr. Qin, and others

30:53.160 --> 30:54.880
have gone to consult the Master every day.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.310
They are planning to strike together

30:56.310 --> 30:58.110
to force Li Zhen to give up power.

31:00.680 --> 31:02.640
Heaven has truly not let me down.

31:04.240 --> 31:06.160
Let them make some more trouble.

31:06.790 --> 31:09.510
When Li Zhen can no longer hold on,

31:10.680 --> 31:12.830
I will ask the clan elders to step in

31:13.640 --> 31:16.020
and kick her out of the Li family
completely.

31:16.020 --> 31:23.170
[Champion of Ink Making]

31:20.680 --> 31:21.480
These are the samples
of the pine soot ink I designed

31:21.480 --> 31:23.310
for Sage Qing He.

31:27.000 --> 31:27.640
Father,

31:28.070 --> 31:29.200
how do you like them?

31:29.510 --> 31:30.440
Good,

31:31.070 --> 31:32.270
very good.

31:32.640 --> 31:34.510
Once we get the Li family's pine timber,

31:34.510 --> 31:36.440
we can start working immediately.

31:36.960 --> 31:38.880
But with the Li family's condition...

31:38.880 --> 31:41.030
The Li family is definitely done for.

31:41.240 --> 31:43.110
Father, don't worry.

31:43.510 --> 31:44.160
Benchang,

31:44.350 --> 31:46.550
I just asked around on the streets.

31:47.200 --> 31:50.160
Li Ink has long been
at the end of its rope.

31:50.240 --> 31:53.700
They started mortgaging
their lands and shops to raise money.

31:54.070 --> 31:55.160
That's not all.

31:56.200 --> 31:58.400
A few days ago,
one of their master craftsmen

31:58.400 --> 31:59.400
quit his job.

31:59.510 --> 32:00.640
And today,

32:00.790 --> 32:03.070
half of the ink-makers went on strike.

32:03.420 --> 32:05.590
They made a fuss along with Li Jingdong,

32:05.590 --> 32:07.450
demanding that Li Zhen step down.

32:08.310 --> 32:10.750
I'm afraid their entire family right now

32:10.750 --> 32:12.830
in a state of panic and total chaos.

32:14.270 --> 32:15.030
Benchang,

32:15.680 --> 32:17.240
your move is quite good.

32:17.960 --> 32:20.350
It fulfilled Sage Qing He's wish

32:20.550 --> 32:21.880
and crushed Li Ink.

32:22.110 --> 32:23.000
It really is

32:23.160 --> 32:25.020
killing two birds with one stone.

32:26.240 --> 32:27.030
Benchang,

32:27.310 --> 32:29.270
you have to make a decision soon.

32:29.830 --> 32:31.790
The Sage
has sent another letter urging us,

32:31.790 --> 32:33.390
asking for his pine soot ink.

32:33.750 --> 32:34.270
Right.

32:36.200 --> 32:38.730
Right now, the whole Li family
is at a dead end.

32:39.400 --> 32:41.590
Even if the Linxi pine yard
is given to them,

32:41.590 --> 32:43.960
Li Zhen doesn't have the ability
to keep it.

32:43.960 --> 32:45.070
After going around in a circle,

32:45.070 --> 32:47.130
it will still come back to our family.

32:47.440 --> 32:49.370
Right now, in the entire Li family,

32:49.590 --> 32:52.450
only Li Zhen is willing to hand over
the pine timber.

32:52.550 --> 32:54.550
If Li Jingdong and those master craftsmen

32:54.550 --> 32:56.810
really drive Li Zhen out of the Li family,

32:57.510 --> 33:00.240
it will be absolutely impossible
for us to get it.

33:00.550 --> 33:01.240
Bensheng.

33:01.640 --> 33:02.680
There's no time to lose.

33:02.680 --> 33:04.920
Prepare the contract
and send it to the Li family immediately.

33:04.920 --> 33:06.850
While they haven't recovered yet,

33:06.920 --> 33:08.380
let's get the pine timber.

33:09.350 --> 33:10.440
I'll go right now.

33:13.590 --> 33:14.160
Here.

33:23.470 --> 33:28.480
[Contract]

33:31.110 --> 33:32.720
Ancestors bless us.

33:33.880 --> 33:36.070
My father's efforts were not in vain.

33:36.720 --> 33:38.680
Our Li Ink is saved.

33:53.830 --> 33:54.440
The...

33:55.960 --> 33:58.680
The lampblack made from rosin oil

33:59.590 --> 34:02.390
is no worse than that made from
pine timber itself.

34:02.790 --> 34:03.720
Manager Zhen,

34:03.880 --> 34:06.110
your method is truly brilliant.

34:06.200 --> 34:07.730
Whether it's the lampblack

34:07.790 --> 34:09.070
or the ink made from it,

34:09.230 --> 34:11.030
it's no worse than pine soot ink.

34:13.550 --> 34:14.400
Eldest Aunt,

34:15.280 --> 34:16.190
Steward Shao,

34:16.880 --> 34:17.880
and gentlemen.

34:18.190 --> 34:21.030
The matter of rosin oil
concerns the survival of Li Ink.

34:21.030 --> 34:23.960
Uncle Jingdong and I
thought about it again and again

34:24.150 --> 34:26.480
and didn't dare to tell everyone lightly.

34:26.590 --> 34:28.280
I lied to you first.

34:28.480 --> 34:29.280
I, Zhen,

34:29.920 --> 34:32.280
apologize to you.

34:32.550 --> 34:33.110
Please don't.

34:33.110 --> 34:34.440
Zhen, please get up.

34:35.800 --> 34:37.840
Everyone understands your intentions.

34:37.840 --> 34:39.110
How could we blame you?

34:39.550 --> 34:41.670
Manager Zhen, please sit.

34:44.670 --> 34:45.710
Masters,

34:47.670 --> 34:49.130
about hiding this matter,

34:49.670 --> 34:51.070
I also knew about it.

34:51.760 --> 34:55.230
You've been kept in the dark
these past few days,

34:55.230 --> 34:56.960
so you must be feeling bad.

34:57.440 --> 34:59.880
I also apologize to you,
all the craftsmen,

35:00.150 --> 35:02.080
Sister-in-law, and Steward Shao,

35:02.190 --> 35:03.360
for this.

35:03.590 --> 35:04.190
Jingdong.

35:05.000 --> 35:06.930
Master, you're being too serious.

35:07.320 --> 35:09.670
You and Manager Zhen have thought things
through very carefully.

35:09.670 --> 35:10.590
Well...

35:10.590 --> 35:11.760
It was us who,

35:12.510 --> 35:14.710
after listening to Liu's instigation,

35:15.320 --> 35:17.070
had improper intentions.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.920
If anyone should apologize,

35:18.920 --> 35:20.880
it should be us.

35:22.000 --> 35:24.460
That's because
you were worried about Li Ink

35:24.480 --> 35:26.140
and have deep feelings for it.

35:27.230 --> 35:28.320
All you craftsmen

35:28.360 --> 35:30.070
are indispensable to Li Ink.

35:30.230 --> 35:31.360
In this crisis,

35:31.550 --> 35:33.670
you have stood by Li Ink through it all.

35:33.670 --> 35:35.590
I will always remember it.

35:37.880 --> 35:38.480
Come in.

35:42.630 --> 35:43.480
Manager Zhen,

35:44.110 --> 35:45.500
the Tian family sent someone to ask.

35:45.500 --> 35:48.630
They want to know
when the pine timber will be delivered.

35:49.670 --> 35:52.030
The pine timber Sixth Grandfather
sacrificed his life for—

35:52.030 --> 35:53.030
the Tian family

35:53.750 --> 35:55.010
won't get it so easily.

36:28.190 --> 36:28.960
Brother!

36:29.760 --> 36:30.480
Father!

36:30.670 --> 36:31.670
Go and take a look!

36:31.740 --> 36:34.400
See how the Li family
delivered the pine timber!

36:34.440 --> 36:35.070
Let's go!

36:37.630 --> 36:38.280
Father!

36:40.880 --> 36:42.670
Stop it! Stop it!

36:42.700 --> 36:44.530
Li Zhen, Li Jingdong!

36:45.030 --> 36:46.190
What are you doing?

36:46.880 --> 36:48.130
We're delivering the pine timber,

36:48.130 --> 36:50.920
and also sending off Sixth Grandfather
who died for it!

36:50.920 --> 36:52.630
Wait. What do you mean by this?

36:53.310 --> 36:55.000
Aren't you doing this on purpose
just to disgust us?

36:55.000 --> 36:57.630
How can our Tian family
do business in the future?

36:57.630 --> 36:58.680
Unload the pine timber!

36:58.680 --> 37:00.990
-Unload the pine timber!
-Unload the pine timber!

37:00.990 --> 37:02.280
Who dares!

37:06.030 --> 37:06.840
No entry!

37:06.860 --> 37:08.190
Step aside! Step aside!

37:08.550 --> 37:09.440
What are you doing?

37:09.440 --> 37:10.040
Who dares?

37:10.730 --> 37:11.560
Bastards!

37:11.710 --> 37:15.550
Sixth Grandfather, rest in peace!

37:16.410 --> 37:19.730
Sixth Grandfather, rest in peace!

37:19.760 --> 37:22.030
-Rest in peace!
-Rest in peace!

37:22.030 --> 37:26.000
Sixth Master, rest in peace!

37:26.000 --> 37:29.000
Sixth Grandfather, rest in peace!

37:29.000 --> 37:30.480
Rest in peace!

37:30.480 --> 37:31.230
You bastard!

37:31.230 --> 37:32.730
Sixth Master, rest in peace!

37:32.730 --> 37:35.610
Sixth Master, rest in peace!

37:36.120 --> 37:37.770
Rest in peace!

37:38.360 --> 37:40.000
The Sixth Master of the Li family
just died.

37:40.000 --> 37:41.840
How could the Tian family do such a thing?

37:41.840 --> 37:42.500
From now on,

37:42.700 --> 37:44.630
it's better to deal with them less.

37:45.230 --> 37:47.360
Rest in peace!

37:48.760 --> 37:50.440
Sixth Grandfather!

37:50.760 --> 37:52.960
Rest in peace!

37:53.230 --> 37:56.480
Sixth Master, rest in peace!

37:57.890 --> 37:59.520
Sixth Grandfather!

37:59.550 --> 38:01.630
Rest in peace!

38:01.670 --> 38:04.110
-Rest in peace!
-Rest in peace!

38:04.710 --> 38:07.480
Sixth Master, rest in peace!

38:12.400 --> 38:14.530
Li Jinhe, the head of the Sixth Branch,

38:14.840 --> 38:18.590
was a man of exceptional virtue,
filial piety, and integrity.

38:18.880 --> 38:22.760
His blessings were as vast as the sea,
and his achievements were remarkable.

38:22.760 --> 38:25.480
Today, I, Li Jingdong,
a member of the Li family,

38:25.630 --> 38:27.150
along with our clansmen,

38:27.480 --> 38:29.140
am opening the ancestral hall

38:29.310 --> 38:30.700
to inform our ancestors about this.

38:29.600 --> 38:32.450
[Guangyu Hall]

38:31.550 --> 38:35.110
We're hanging his portrait
in Li's Ancestral Hall.

38:32.650 --> 38:36.450
[In Memory of Jinhe of the Li Family]

38:35.190 --> 38:39.710
We hope our ancestors' virtues
will bless us forever.

38:40.110 --> 38:44.550
Please accept these modest offerings.

38:57.000 --> 38:58.360
Everyone lied to me.

39:00.510 --> 39:02.000
They all lied to me.

39:05.230 --> 39:07.880
Everyone in this family
treats me like an outsider.

39:07.880 --> 39:11.210
They are all in league
with that girl from the Eighth Branch!

39:16.480 --> 39:17.320
Who is it?

39:17.880 --> 39:18.920
What do you want?

39:18.960 --> 39:20.110
Fourth Young Lady.

39:20.190 --> 39:22.650
Zhen wants to speak with you
in the main hall.

39:28.800 --> 39:29.840
Fine.

39:30.280 --> 39:32.210
I was just about to look for her too.

39:33.070 --> 39:35.070
It's time to settle things with her.

39:44.230 --> 39:45.110
What is it?

39:46.500 --> 39:48.740
Do you have nothing to say to everyone?

39:49.480 --> 39:50.410
Sister-in-law,

39:50.840 --> 39:52.760
you were the ones who called me here.

39:52.760 --> 39:54.190
And now you're asking me?

39:56.400 --> 39:59.270
Leaking the news of mortgaging
the fields to the ink merchants

39:59.270 --> 40:01.800
and inciting Mr. Liu
to resign to shake morale

40:02.670 --> 40:04.260
were all your doing, right?

40:06.030 --> 40:06.710
Yes.

40:07.480 --> 40:08.710
So what?

40:11.030 --> 40:12.630
Let me make it clear today.

40:13.110 --> 40:13.880
Li Zhen,

40:14.510 --> 40:16.190
I don't trust you at all,

40:16.880 --> 40:18.880
nor do I accept you
taking charge of Li Ink.

40:18.880 --> 40:19.880
Tian Jiangyue.

40:20.480 --> 40:22.010
You speak without thinking

40:22.400 --> 40:24.630
and have repeatedly
harmed Li Ink's interests.

40:24.630 --> 40:27.400
Today, as the head of the family,

40:27.400 --> 40:28.630
I fine you a year's allowance

40:28.630 --> 40:30.510
and ground you for a month.

40:31.110 --> 40:31.840
How dare you!

40:31.840 --> 40:33.500
It's not about whether I dare,

40:33.840 --> 40:35.370
but that in this family now,

40:36.180 --> 40:37.310
I have the final say.

40:41.280 --> 40:43.230
Third Brother, Sister-in-law,

40:43.400 --> 40:45.670
are you just going to let her
treat me like this?

40:45.670 --> 40:47.130
When Mother was in charge,

40:47.520 --> 40:49.290
she never even scolded me once.

40:49.310 --> 40:50.180
Tian Jiangyue,

40:50.440 --> 40:52.100
you've gone too far this time.

40:54.000 --> 40:55.710
Considering you lost your husband,

40:55.710 --> 40:57.770
we've let you have your way for years.

40:58.070 --> 41:01.000
But this time,
in the family's moment of crisis,

41:01.110 --> 41:02.880
you kicked us when we were down.

41:02.880 --> 41:04.360
You know that I hate traitors

41:04.360 --> 41:07.400
more than anything in my life.

41:08.030 --> 41:09.070
So this time,

41:09.760 --> 41:11.030
I can't help you.

41:12.710 --> 41:13.550
Fine.

41:14.360 --> 41:15.230
Fine.

41:16.630 --> 41:17.710
I see.

41:18.110 --> 41:19.920
Now I understand everything.

41:20.880 --> 41:23.630
In this family, I'm just an outsider.

41:23.760 --> 41:24.400
Getting rid of me

41:24.400 --> 41:26.480
will satisfy you, won't it?

41:27.610 --> 41:29.720
Every single one of you is full of lies.

41:29.720 --> 41:31.780
You've deceived me for so many years,

41:32.040 --> 41:34.040
just waiting for the Eighth Branch
to return to the clan,

41:34.040 --> 41:35.440
so you could kick me out.

41:35.440 --> 41:37.880
Then you'd still be one big happy family.

41:37.920 --> 41:38.800
Enough!

41:39.150 --> 41:40.110
Tian Jiangyue!

41:40.590 --> 41:43.000
Your punishment
is based entirely on your actions.

41:43.000 --> 41:44.840
You are the one who did wrong.

41:45.630 --> 41:47.880
My only mistake is living until now,

41:48.070 --> 41:49.960
being an eyesore to all of you!

41:51.320 --> 41:53.250
You are teaming up to humiliate me.

41:54.230 --> 41:55.960
I might as well die right now...

41:59.440 --> 42:00.480
to give you what you want!

42:00.480 --> 42:02.410
Tian Jiangyue, what are you doing?

42:03.110 --> 42:03.800
Jiangyue!

42:04.670 --> 42:05.510
Don't touch me!

42:05.510 --> 42:06.150
Let go!

42:06.340 --> 42:07.960
Third Aunt, don't stop her!

42:07.960 --> 42:08.760
Let her die.

42:10.000 --> 42:10.530
Go ahead.

42:11.230 --> 42:12.490
Didn't you want to die?

42:12.670 --> 42:13.670
Do it!

42:14.320 --> 42:14.920
What?

42:15.400 --> 42:16.360
Are you scared?

42:17.180 --> 42:18.110
Are you a coward?

42:20.920 --> 42:21.710
Li Zhen,

42:22.630 --> 42:24.320
I'll take you down with me!

42:24.550 --> 42:25.720
Li Zhen!

42:26.000 --> 42:26.920
Take her away!

42:27.630 --> 42:29.000
Let me go!

42:29.230 --> 42:30.320
Li Zhen!

42:30.400 --> 42:32.320
You are the daughter of a murderer!

42:32.320 --> 42:34.590
You have a murderer's blood in your veins.

42:34.590 --> 42:34.880
Take her away!

42:34.880 --> 42:36.880
How many lives will you take
from the Li family

42:36.880 --> 42:38.110
before you stop?

42:38.320 --> 42:39.670
Let me go!

42:39.760 --> 42:42.400
Li Jingdong, you are a man!

42:42.630 --> 42:44.440
But you've been
following a girl around every day

42:44.440 --> 42:45.480
to make a living!

42:45.480 --> 42:47.280
What dignity do you have left?

42:47.480 --> 42:48.840
And Sister-in-law!

42:49.070 --> 42:50.590
Don't think I don't know!

42:50.670 --> 42:54.150
You were also kept in the dark
about the pine timber exchange!

42:54.400 --> 42:56.110
This girl lied to you today.

42:56.110 --> 42:57.960
She will lie to you about everything
from now on!

42:57.960 --> 42:59.510
Let go of me!
